 "notes": [
  "Qty 61 as published: the 'Starting (7)' section lists 8 lines (the Objective, Death Star II: Throne Room, Your Destiny, Insignificant Rebellion, Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order and 'Variable Effect'); the other sections match their headers, which total 60.",
  "'Variable Effect' is kept as posted (UNKNOWN, left out of GEMP): the strategy says 'Arrest Order and Mobil Points are always start and the 3rd effect depends on the opponent's start' and suggests Battle Order or Oppressive Enforcement (neither is in the list) or You Cannot Hide Forever. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Burn Him Before Me' (the deck's pun name) dested the Objective Bring Him Before Me / Take Your Father's Place. Secret Plans is an Effect in 2000 (not the Reflections III Defensive Shield).",
  "Posted 'CC Docking Bay' dested Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay); 'Executor  DBay' Executor: Docking Bay; 'Coruscant  DB' Coruscant: Docking Bay; 'Captain Godhert' Captain Godherdt; '4-LOM w/ Gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Fett in Slave 1' Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Vader's Shuttle' Vader's Personal Shuttle; 'Emperor's Shuttle' Emperor's Personal Shuttle; 'Shut Him Up' Shut Him Up Or Shut Him Down; 'Prescence of the Force' Presence Of The Force.",
  "The author's later post 10356 'Final-Burn Him Before Me' (10 September 2000) reposts this deck with changes."
